(Character kinds: 1 is a letter, 2 is a digit, 3 is a space, 4 is any other symbol.)
Procedure classify takes c as integer returns integer:
    If c is equal to the character " " then:
        Return 3.
    End if.
    If c is greater than or equal to the character "a" and c is less than or equal to the character "z" then:
        Return 1.
    End if.
    If c is greater than or equal to the character "0" and c is less than or equal to the character "9" then:
        Return 2.
    End if.
    Return 4.
End procedure.

(The text "12 ab+c3 4" stored one character code per element.)
Declare text as array of integer with length 10 with values the character "1" followed by the character "2" followed by the character " " followed by the character "a" followed by the character "b" followed by the character "+" followed by the character "c" followed by the character "3" followed by the character " " followed by the character "4" done.

(State 0 is between tokens, 1 is inside a word, 2 is inside a number.)
Declare state as integer with value 0.
Declare words as integer with value 0.
Declare numbers as integer with value 0.
Declare symbols as integer with value 0.

For i from 0 to 9:
    Declare kind as integer with value Call classify with Element at i in text done.
    Switch state:
        When 0:
            If kind is equal to 1 then:
                Set state to 1.
                Add 1 to words.
            End if.
            If kind is equal to 2 then:
                Set state to 2.
                Add 1 to numbers.
            End if.
            If kind is equal to 4 then:
                Add 1 to symbols.
            End if.
            Break.
        When 1:
            If kind is equal to 3 then:
                Set state to 0.
            End if.
            If kind is equal to 4 then:
                Set state to 0.
                Add 1 to symbols.
            End if.
            Break.
        When 2:
            If kind is equal to 1 then:
                Set state to 1.
                Add 1 to words.
            End if.
            If kind is equal to 3 then:
                Set state to 0.
            End if.
            If kind is equal to 4 then:
                Set state to 0.
                Add 1 to symbols.
            End if.
            Break.
        Otherwise:
            Break.
    End switch.
End for.

Say "Words: " plus words.
Say "Numbers: " plus numbers.
Say "Symbols: " plus symbols.
